Binary distribution
-------------------
Keep the accompanying legal files when redistributing a build. They are in
assets/legal/ in Android APKs and usr/share/doc/j2play/legal/ in Linux packages.
They include LICENSE, this NOTICE, font attribution, dependency licenses and
applicable native/runtime notices. dependencies.json provides exact source
archive URLs and checksums. Unmodified MPL-2.0 Symphonia source is available
from those URLs. J2Play's patches are at https://github.com/mny315/J2Play.
